{"unit_id":"v587d__dsh-search-first#card-zh","repo":"v587d/dsh-search-first","commit":"1979af06de5b54fc920d6aa70bf722baf62a882e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-search-first 是面向 DSH web 客户端的网页搜索插件，会在模型回答前运行搜索流程。它接入 agent/pre-step，把用户问题提取为搜索计划，调用多个搜索服务并获取网页内容，再将带来源的摘要和引用格式提示加入当前模型上下文。功能包括按优先级切换搜索服务、并行搜索、结果排序去重、缓存以及运行记录保存，并提供设置页和会话开关。适合希望回答前先查网页、查看来源的 DSH 用户；需配置至少一种搜索服务凭据，也可使用可用的 DSH web 搜索回退。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:76-85","src/pre-step.ts:114-145","src/engine/pipeline.ts:43-103"]}
{"unit_id":"v587d__dsh-search-first#card-en","repo":"v587d/dsh-search-first","commit":"1979af06de5b54fc920d6aa70bf722baf62a882e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-search-first searches the web before DSH replies. It creates queries, searches providers, fetches pages, and adds source summaries and citation guidance to context. It supports failover, parallel search, ranking, caching, and run records. Configure a provider credential.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:76-85","src/pre-step.ts:114-145","src/engine/pipeline.ts:43-103"]}
